{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the <strong>Running Riot</strong> gauntlet, where you'll engage in <strong>heart-pounding</strong> combat against enemies trying to take you down! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/0d36bbfa10c62720a587a2b99dc8de2f.poster.avif?t=1754064945\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/0d36bbfa10c62720a587a2b99dc8de2f.webm?t=1754064945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/0d36bbfa10c62720a587a2b99dc8de2f.mp4?t=1754064945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Devastating Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/f40f33625fc47f7f438c54b77b8bbaa1.poster.avif?t=1754064945\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/f40f33625fc47f7f438c54b77b8bbaa1.webm?t=1754064945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/f40f33625fc47f7f438c54b77b8bbaa1.mp4?t=1754064945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're no pushover. You'll gain Upgrades as you level up, making your abilities stronger. Your choices will determine whether victory will be yours!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/7ea8a8b2437fb467c9ac005177a98acf.poster.avif?t=1754064945\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/7ea8a8b2437fb467c9ac005177a98acf.webm?t=1754064945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/7ea8a8b2437fb467c9ac005177a98acf.mp4?t=1754064945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class comes with its own set of unique abilities, upgrades, and meta-progression perks. Classes present new playstyles to master and new opportunities to nail that <strong>perfect run</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Score Attack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/013a8deb43a1c0fd88ccf4e953cd6662.poster.avif?t=1754064945\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/013a8deb43a1c0fd88ccf4e953cd6662.webm?t=1754064945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/013a8deb43a1c0fd88ccf4e953cd6662.mp4?t=1754064945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run grants you Running Riot <strong>Tickets </strong>based on how high you score. Use those tickets to buy perks and get even higher scores! So keep on <i>running</i>, keep on <i>rioting</i>, and you'll keep on finding more explosive ways to play! Don't forget to see how you rank amongst other players.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2284000/7431bb7a78b7f6edc5a7c9d49bcb718189424d65.jpg"},{"name":"Part 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2284000/801672fedf7cc1bda10006301f4e7f5d61ff28a7.jpg"},{"name":"Commando Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2284000/b80de71fb7eebee7b1bd8eaf69e91aa7737b20ee.jpg"},{"name":"Spoils of War","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2284000/dcdfbb1934d664cf591c535ae61598674d55cc7f.jpg"},{"name":"Guard Detail","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2284000/243ce7b14a13001ced53567b8fa628c706f121c0.jpg"},{"name":"Raise the Flag","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2284000/a22598b8f8706d041528f5ad16d30710b6328aaa.jpg"},{"name":"Crowd Control","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2284000/0ec11c229a3329996a60ffea8ff2daab49173568.jpg"},{"name":"Charged Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2284000/8cc769222d8c56c3b3895ff1f0d0d3dd5daa7a32.jpg"},{"name":"Honored","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2284000/ad20cc10ce8e5898a75e72768f603194524766d6.jpg"},{"name":"Exalted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2284000/71071bf1da997f7ab19bcc16f9f9e430749f7820.jpg"}],"total":40},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2284000?t=1754064945","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2284000?t=1754064945","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/aaf730ce24bb5f5c3afb37c879aab60ed1af6d9a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754064945","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/aaf730ce24bb5f5c3afb37c879aab60ed1af6d9a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754064945","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2324630,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the <strong>Running Riot</strong> gauntlet, where you'll engage in <strong>heart-pounding</strong> combat against enemies trying to take you down! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/0d36bbfa10c62720a587a2b99dc8de2f.poster.avif?t=1754064945\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/0d36bbfa10c62720a587a2b99dc8de2f.webm?t=1754064945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/0d36bbfa10c62720a587a2b99dc8de2f.mp4?t=1754064945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Devastating Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/f40f33625fc47f7f438c54b77b8bbaa1.poster.avif?t=1754064945\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/f40f33625fc47f7f438c54b77b8bbaa1.webm?t=1754064945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/f40f33625fc47f7f438c54b77b8bbaa1.mp4?t=1754064945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're no pushover. You'll gain Upgrades as you level up, making your abilities stronger. Your choices will determine whether victory will be yours!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/7ea8a8b2437fb467c9ac005177a98acf.poster.avif?t=1754064945\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/7ea8a8b2437fb467c9ac005177a98acf.webm?t=1754064945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/7ea8a8b2437fb467c9ac005177a98acf.mp4?t=1754064945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class comes with its own set of unique abilities, upgrades, and meta-progression perks. Classes present new playstyles to master and new opportunities to nail that <strong>perfect run</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Score Attack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/013a8deb43a1c0fd88ccf4e953cd6662.poster.avif?t=1754064945\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/013a8deb43a1c0fd88ccf4e953cd6662.webm?t=1754064945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/extras/013a8deb43a1c0fd88ccf4e953cd6662.mp4?t=1754064945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run grants you Running Riot <strong>Tickets </strong>based on how high you score. Use those tickets to buy perks and get even higher scores! So keep on <i>running</i>, keep on <i>rioting</i>, and you'll keep on finding more explosive ways to play! Don't forget to see how you rank amongst other players.</p>","developers":["Party Moose Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284000/3840fd57fd2fd566ac7fddad901895bfe0d9cbf0